                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "At my town halls in eastern CT, people are seriously concerned about health care cuts in the so-called \"One Big Beautiful Bill\" H.R. 1. These cuts would take away health care for 15 million Americans & put our hospitals in dire financial straits. No wonder hospitals from all across the country are strongly opposed to this bill.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
