                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "All sorts of ugly provisions are slithering out of the \u201cBig Beautiful Bill\u201d \u2013 including health care cuts that are so bad, hospitals will be forced to close. \n\nThe House passed the bill in the DEAD OF NIGHT last month. Now, the Senate is making it even WORSE. We've got to block this ugly bill.",
