                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "If Congress does not act very soon, Kristin McShane, a small business owner from Norwich, will see her family\u2019s ACA health care premiums go up from $800/month to $1,800/month next year.\n\nKristan and her husband Charlie joined me in Middletown today with her new premium bill to tell Speaker Johnson to bring the House back now to reopen the government and prevent skyrocketing health care costs for small businesses.",
